WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:06,780
I really didn't expect that today

2
00:00:06,780 --> 00:00:11,420
Mainly because Lin Zichen keeps pestering me

3
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:12,420
boyfriend

4
00:00:12,420 --> 00:00:14,420
I just want to tell him

5
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:17,980
I already have a boyfriend

6
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:19,980
If I had known they were touching that

7
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:25,030
I definitely won't take you there, it'll be okay

8
00:00:25,030 --> 00:00:27,380
An elder once taught me a sentence

9
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:29,860
Don't always feel that you have done something wrong

10
00:00:29,860 --> 00:00:32,600
Don't take other people's mistakes

11
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:33,600
Take it upon yourself

12
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:36,880
You just come to the party normally

13
00:00:36,880 --> 00:00:40,190
They are the ones who committed the crime

14
00:00:40,190 --> 00:00:41,190
Not you
